# gridbot intl<->PMUS join coverage — oneshot, fired daily by its timer.
#
# WHY: H-CROSSVENUE1's join is the lane's go/no-go, and a join that DEGRADES
# looks exactly like "no opportunities" unless coverage is tracked over time.
# This writes the daily breakdown (joined, by kind, by orientation, and the
# refusal reasons) to the journal so the series exists when the hypothesis is
# registered.
#
# SCOPE: coverage ONLY — no basis, lead, edge or PnL. The hypothesis is not
# pre-registered and measuring before the freeze (2026-09-07T06:39:27Z) would
# burn the holdout. Analysis lane, read-only, no trade path, no keys.
[Unit]
Description=gridbot intl-PMUS join coverage (analysis only; no trade path)

[Service]
Type=oneshot
WorkingDirectory=/home/ops/gridbot
ExecStart=/home/ops/.local/bin/uv run python scripts/crossvenue_coverage.py
NoNewPrivileges=true
PrivateTmp=true
